      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "10px uppercase navigation with 0.4em tracking and a fine animated underline; the application replaces it with a disclosure below 1024px. The full-width beige #e3ded5 sticky header is 79px tall on desktop and tablet, 72px below 768px, with a centered inner width of at most 1180px. Its BMYGYM serif wordmark has no tagline and uses 21px type with 0.3em tracking, becoming 20px / 0.22em below 768px and 18px / 0.18em below 360px.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"#philosophy\">Philosophy</a><a href=\"#environments\">Environments</a><a href=\"#approach\">Our Approach</a><a href=\"#vision\">Vision</a></nav>",
